{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdzZDzFb7z9tQDShEQDCZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Plan\n\n1. **Call `payments.provider_status()`** immediately to check if the provider is alive and responsive. This is a safe read-only probe that tells us if cold-start is still in progress.\n\n2. **Call `payments.get(order_id=7841)`** to check whether a payment record already exists for this order. If a payment was created before the timeout, it will appear here.\n\n3. **Decide based on results:**\n   - If `get()` returns a payment record: **Do NOT retry `submit()`**. The original call succeeded; the timeout was just a slow response.\n   - If `get()` returns nothing AND `provider_status()` shows healthy: **Retry `payments.submit(order_id=7841, amount_usd=120.00)` once** after a brief delay. The provider is ready now.\n   - If `provider_status()` shows the provider is still unhealthy/cold-starting: **Wait and retry the status check** before attempting `submit()` again.\n\n4. If the retry `submit()` also times out, **escalate** rather than retry again (unclear idempotency guarantees in a hung state).\n\n**Explicit statement:** Retry `payments.submit()` **only once**, and only after confirming via `get()` that no payment exists AND `provider_status()` shows the provider is healthy."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":260,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":317,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
